# These patterns are anchored at the context root, so `node_modules` and `dist`
# above do NOT cover the console's. Exclude them explicitly: the `web` stage
# runs its own `npm ci` and its own build, so a locally-built dashboard must
# never be copied in and shadow the one the image builds.
web/node_modules
web/dist
# DO NOT add a `**/.env*` pattern. `web/.env.production` is build configuration,
# not a secret — it holds the relative API base — and excluding it would produce
# a console silently stuck on fixtures. The `ARG VITE_ARI_API` in the Dockerfile
# is the second belt on that.
